@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:5111

### Live host: 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Due loan: 200 Sent (logs only; repeated requests produce repeated attempts)
POST {{baseUrl}}/loans/20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/reminders

### Future loan: 200 NotRequired
POST {{baseUrl}}/loans/20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002/reminders

### Returned loan: 200 NotRequired
POST {{baseUrl}}/loans/20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003/reminders

### Missing loan: 404 Problem Details
POST {{baseUrl}}/loans/20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000004/reminders

### Empty identifier: 400 Problem Details
POST {{baseUrl}}/loans/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/reminders
